    "class": "Mcp::Tools::Transactions::Classify",
    "name": "transactions.classify",
    "description": "Apply a merchant + category to a bank transaction.\nmode=only_this writes the override on this row only.\nmode=all_for_merchant sets merchant.default_category - all rows for the merchant inherit.\nmode=create_rule creates a user-source MerchantRule (rule_field/rule_kind/rule_pattern required) and rebuilds enrichment.",
